## Interview Talking Points

- Why simulated data?
  Real-time fraud systems use streaming data, not static datasets.

- Why separate event_time and ingestion_time?
  To handle late-arriving data and watermarking.

- Why bronze–silver–gold?
  Industry-standard data modeling for scalable analytics.

- Why PySpark?
  Distributed processing for high-volume streaming data.
